OL,3,GNEWSAFarmers told it is 'not too late'
OL,4,Ato fight virus outbreak
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Agriculture and Horticulture
OL,7,FDevelopment Board (AHDB) is hosting an
OL,8,Fevent at Bakewell Auction Mart on
OL,9,FMonday to give farmers the chance to
OL,10,Ffind out more about vaccination and
OL,11,Fother support available from experts.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
